---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About MJ PDF and this website." path="/about/" crumbs={[{name:'About',path:'/about/'}]}>
  <div class="wrap page-h"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</nav>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem);margin-top:1rem">About MJ PDF</h1></div>
  <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <p>MJ PDF is a PDF reader for Android made by {SITE.author}. Versions 1 and 2 were based on PDF Viewer Plus; according to the project, the app was entirely rewritten in 3.0.0.</p>
    <p>This website presents version 3.1.0. It is an independent presentation of the app, not the project's own page. The project's official page is <a href={SITE.links.official} rel="noopener">mudlej.com/projects/mj-pdf</a>.</p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:36px">Links</h2>
    <ul class="checks"><li><a href={SITE.links.source} rel="noopener">Source code and issues (GitLab)</a></li><li><a href={SITE.links.mirror} rel="noopener">GitHub mirror</a></li></ul>
  </div></section>
</Base>
